[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/data/spawn_group.gd" id="2_group"]

; v1.0 wave 7 (docs/31 6.1; decision D171). Group counts, offsets and
; intervals are Register "v1.0 Enemies, Bosses & Waves" > "Wave sequence"
; starting values (Soldier, spawn count x1.0); the difficulty profile scales
; the counts at spawn time. minimum_recovery_gap_seconds is the Register's
; 6 s inter-wave gap (10 s before a boss wave).

